==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|pt|la|continuāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|continuō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Portugal}} {{IPA|pt|/kõ.ti.ˈnwaɾ/}}
* {{a|Brazil}} {{IPA|pt|/kõ.t͡ʃi.nu.ˈa(ʁ)/}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb|continu|ar}}

# {{indtr|pt|com|direct=1|intr=1}} to {{l|en|continue}}; to {{l|en|go on}} with {{gloss|not to stop}}
#* {{RQ:mul:Rowling Harry Potter|pt-BR|5|page=294|text=[...] o único professor presente quando entraram [na sala de aula] era Binns, [...] preparando-se para '''continuar''' sua monótona lengalenga sobre a guerra dos gigantes.|t=[...] the only present teacher when they entered [the classroom] was Binns, [...] preparing to continue his monotonous explanation about the giants' war.}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Continue''' até não aguentar mais.|inline=1|'''Keep going''' until you can stand it any more.}}
#: {{ux|pt|Os soldados não queriam '''continuar''' com a guerra.|inline=1|The soldiers didn’t want to '''continue''' with the war.}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Continuamos''' o jogo apesar da chuva.|inline=1|'''We went on''' with the game despite the rain.}}
#: {{syn|pt|prosseguir}}
#: {{ant|pt|[[parar]] [[com]]}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to {{l|en|continue}}; to {{l|en|proceed}} with {{gloss|to start doing something that had been stopped}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Continuarei''' o projeto quando receber a verba.|inline=1|'''I will proceeded''' with the project when I get the budget.}}
#: {{syn|pt|[[prosseguir]] [[com]]}}
#: {{ant|pt|[[parar]] ([[com]])|pausar|interromper}}
# {{lb|pt|auxiliary|_|with a verb in the gerund or with '''{{l|pt|a}}''' and a verb in the impersonal infinitive}} to {{l|en|continue}}; to {{l|en|keep}}; to be still {{gloss|not to stop doing something}}
#: {{ux|pt|Mandei um técnico consertar meu computador mas ele '''continua''' fazendo um barulho estranho.|I had a technician fix my computer but it '''is still''' making a strange noise.}}
#: {{syn|pt|permanecer|prosseguir|seguir}}
#: {{ant|pt|[[parar]] [[de]]|[[deixar]] [[de]]}}
# {{lb|pt|copulative}} to {{l|en|continue}}; to {{l|en|remain}} {{gloss|to retain a given quality}}
#: {{ux|pt|Mesmo com o novo governador, os impostos '''continuam''' altos.|inline=1|Even with the new governor, taxes '''remain''' high.}}
#: {{syn|pt|seguir}}
# {{lb|pt|intransitive|usually|takes an adverb phrase}} to {{l|en|extend}} {{gloss|to have a given extent}}
#: {{ux|pt|Essa estrada '''continua''' por uns vinte quilómetros.|inline=1|This road '''goes on''' for some twenty kilometres.}}
#: {{syn|pt|[[estender]]-[[se]]|ir|[[prolongar]]-[[se]]|seguir}}

